Z||000000||BlackDragon||09-04-2001||12:50 AM||||that about says it, i want to take the radiator hole in the bumper, connect it directly (sealed) to the radiator, then (still sealed) to the fans, then ( of course, still sealed) out the hood. bu i would like to find a nice inverted hood scoop to do it with. i would rather buy an entire hood with the scoop already mounted. is there a company that sells these? <P>------------------<BR>im looking for a inexpensive black standard fastback. does not have to run. does not have to look good. only the mid section needs to be dent free. the fenders,bumpers, dont have to be in good cond. faded paint is fine. anyone who has info, email me. grey interior would be nice but beggars cant be choosers||||reg||1
