Z||000002||Pontiaddict||09-04-2001||03:01 AM||||You might be better off just cutting a hole in the hood and making the ductwork from the radiator out to the hole in the hood. <BR>Also, make sure you duct the air from the hole in the bottom of the GT fascia and not just the hole in the front.<p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 09-04-2001).]||||reg||1
